      "stem": "The inverse of the function given by y = 2x + 8 is",
      "options": {
        "A": "y = 0.5x - 8",
        "B": "y = 0.5x - 4",
        "C": "y = 2x - 4",
        "D": "y = 2x - 8",
        "E": "y = 0.5x + 4"
      },
      "answer": "B",
      "accepted_answers": ["B"],
      "explanation_steps": [
        "y = 2x + 8 ⇒ y - 8 = 2x ⇒ x = (y - 8)/2 = 0.5y - 4.",
        "Swap variables: y = 0.5x - 4. Answer: B."
